should format like this (where in the first case we don't break the `||` chain because it still fits)

```r
if (
  this || this || this || this || this || this || this || this || this || this
) {
  1
} else {
  2
}

if (
  this ||
    this ||
    this ||
    this ||
    this ||
    this ||
    this ||
    this ||
    this ||
    this ||
    this ||
    this
) {
  1
} else {
